  "description": "Paper Frog is a spring rider shaped like a folded paper frog, in a dark green Mineral shade with yellow handles. A child can rock it alone by jumping gently on the rear legs or pressing down, so nobody has to push. A friend or parent can join in from the back. It suits ages 3 to 12 and fits small corners easily, with a product area of 2'6\" x 1'6\" and a safe play area of 6'6\" x 5'6\". Riding it builds balance and imaginative play. The roto-moulded body carries our 3-year warranty, and the spring is covered for 1 year. Add it beside a larger Kagzi structure and we will mark both on one layout drawing.",
